{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026VZYbE5sU4W1794816112.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>證監會主席黃天祐表示，新指數能產生乘數效應，為點心債市場帶來更清晰的資訊與投資決策，本港未來要成為讓資本停泊、投資及增長的深層次市場。</p><p></p><p>證監會主席黃天祐說：「香港不應只是一個讓資本流過的通道，而應是一個讓資本停留、投資並增長的市場。這意味著我們要從單純的門戶，發展成為更具深度的離岸人民幣資產市場。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T08:55:28.753302+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T07:58:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T09:24:56.245729+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T08:48:41.843134+00:00","content_hash":"127e5c0bb9de1cca2a642ed43211c02cab9c0fc42245a76bd93d38020d18e866","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T08:55:28.753302+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}